  "reason": "No experiments have been completed, so there is no evidence favoring any RNA encoder, profile setting, aggregation, image encoder, or fusion method. The main uncertainty is the baseline performance of the simplest RNA-only model. config_001 tests a minimal, low-risk single-profile PCA baseline without introducing multiprofile aggregation, learned encoders, or image/fusion confounds. It is the best next experiment because it is cheap and robust, establishes a reference validation accuracy, and enables clean later comparisons to multiprofile, learned RNA encoders, image-only, and multimodal configurations under a limited budget."
}

